index 0000000..edb77d7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/69962.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Added support for a "minimum" usage threshold to the ``diskusage`` beacon, alongside the
+existing "maximum" threshold, so operators can alert when a mount's usage unexpectedly drops
+(often a sign the filesystem failed to mount). Existing single-value configuration continues
+to work unchanged as a maximum-only threshold.
